== diagnostics ==
warning[W0902]: nested comprehension over a list without `@length(max: n)`
 --> app/app.veld:13:34
   |
13 |   rule unbounded: all(rows, r => all(r.cells, c => c.v > 0))
   |                                  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  = help: the cost grows with the product of both lists; bound them with `@length(max: n)`

warning[W0902]: nested comprehension over a list without `@length(max: n)`
 --> app/app.veld:14:41
   |
14 |   rule innerUnbounded: all(capped, r => all(r.cells, c => c.v > 0))
   |                                         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  = help: the cost grows with the product of both lists; bound them with `@length(max: n)`

warning[W0902]: nested comprehension over a list without `@length(max: n)`
 --> app/app.veld:15:39
   |
15 |   rule outerUnbounded: all(rows, r => all(r.bounded, c => c.v > 0))
   |                                       ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  = help: the cost grows with the product of both lists; bound them with `@length(max: n)`

